Chenyang City No. 1 Middle School, the classroom of Class 2, Grade 3, was filled with solemn silence;
More than fifty young boys and girls stared at the bald middle-aged man on the podium with expectant faces.
"Ahem~" Huang Bo coughed lightly, suppressing the smile on his lips, "What, why are you looking at me?"
"Old Ban, I see you are a little more handsome than yesterday!" A young man with a sunny temperament said.
"No big one, no small one!" Huang Bo couldn't hold himself any longer. He grinned widely and cursed, "Okay, I won't tease you anymore. Look at how anxious you are."
Immediately turn on the projector and start playing a video;
"Watch it well. It doesn't matter if you can't remember it. This video has been sent to your terminal and can be viewed at any time.
However, external spreading is strictly prohibited! "
The video starts playing, showing a 3D modeled human figure;
Inside the human body, threads suddenly flow like life;
There are three big characters at the top: "Quanyuan Gong"!
In the last row of the classroom, by the window, a handsome-looking young man was also staring at the projection attentively;
The sun shining through the window reflected his broken hair, giving him an air of youth.
Chu Yuan is not a person from this world, but a time traveler;
However, more than ten years have passed, and he sometimes forgets his identity as a time traveler.
In this world, apart from the words and race being exactly the same as those in the previous life, everything else has nothing to do with it;
Martial arts are revived and alien species are rampant!
It can be said that everything is inferior, only martial arts is high.
However, most people actually do not have the potential to become warriors, and in the end they have no choice but to devote themselves to various industries.
This distribution of exercises is the last screening;
If you can advance to the Qi and Blood Realm with this set of basic exercises within a month, you can go to martial arts university!
Otherwise, you can just do whatever you have to do.
Because in one month, it will be the day of the college entrance examination.
The Yuan Yuan Gong is actually not mysterious, let alone precious. Almost everyone in Da Qin has practiced it;
However, the law explicitly prohibits students under the age of 18 from watching.
One of the reasons is that starting to practice at a young age can easily overdraw your body’s potential;
The most obvious feature is that he is not tall.
But that’s not the main reason. The main reason is screening!
When most factors are the same, whoever makes faster progress in practicing basic skills will be more talented in martial arts;
It is a very simple and intuitive way of judging, and people with better talents will be better cultivated.
Three days ago, Chu Yuan and the others conducted a census. Anyone who practiced martial arts in advance was not allowed to attend the martial arts university!
Of course, some people may ask, even if they practice the exercises at the same time, if someone’s family has money, they can buy various supplements and resources;
Some are destitute and without any outside help;
In the end, isn’t it possible to achieve absolutely fair screening?
This is indeed the case. Officials cannot prohibit parents from purchasing martial arts resources for their children;
But this kind of screening mechanism has always existed. Even if there are warriors who are not talented enough and rely on resources to accumulate resources, their secrets will be revealed sooner or later!
Moreover, the school itself has support quotas for geniuses
As a basic exercise commonly used across the country, it is not difficult to get started with Que Yuan Gong;
Chu Yuan quickly memorized the flow routes of those lines, and followed the above explanation to try to absorb energy from the outside world.
But when the first ray of energy entered the body, before Chu Yuan had time to carefully feel what it felt like, a voice suddenly sounded in his mind!
【bite! Blue Star System-Xian Dao Special Edition has been restarted!
It is detected that the host has learned the skill "Quanyuan Gong";
